# Typography: one font family

UI uses a **single sans stack** (`font-sans` / `--bokdy-font-sans`: Be Vietnam Pro → Roboto). Do not introduce a second typeface for codes, OTP, or IDs.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
className="font-mono text-xs"
<code className="font-mono">…

// ✅ GOOD — same family; use size/weight/tracking only
className="text-xs tracking-wide"
```

Do not add `font-mono`, `font-serif`, or extra `next/font` faces for UI chrome. OTP and IDs stay in `font-sans`.
